    "rho_lead": "Exhibitors, buyers and corporate delegations leaving Fiera Milano Rho (East and South Gates after Lineapelle, Salone del Mobile, MICAM, EICMA or TuttoFood) reach Milan's top VIP terraces and panoramic rooftops in 12 to 24 minutes via the M1 Red metro and M5 Lilac interchange at Lotto. The closest true sky terrace to Rho Fiera is 20th-floor Voya Rooftop at Viale Achille Papa 30 (M5 Portello, 12 minutes from Rho Fiera, 85 metres high with 360-degree skyline views, cocktail dinner and VIP bottle lounges), while staying on M1 straight to Duomo (24 minutes, zero transfers) leads directly to Terrazza Duomo 21 overlooking the Cathedral spires and MIB Piazza Affari.",
    "rho_deep": "For larger corporate dinners, private terraces and late-night bottle service, Sempione and Garibaldi sit 15-18 minutes from Rho Fiera: 55 Milano offers a 1,000 sqm industrial loft and private open-air terrace on Via Piero della Francesca 55 (0% agency fee on WhatsApp), Just Me Milano hosts garden and crystal-dome VIP tables beneath Torre Branca 7 nights a week (0% partner fee), Pineta and The Grace Club run singing dinners at M5 Cenisio, and Radio Rooftop crowns the 10th floor of ME Milan Il Duca near Porta Nuova. VAT corporate invoicing and custom group menus for 10 to 150 guests are coordinated on WhatsApp +39 351 912 7047.",
