    "mgz_lead": "International visitors searching for 'Magazine Milano discoteca' or 'Club Magazine Milan' are almost always looking for two connected pillars of Milan's clubbing map: first, the iconic industrial warehouse club Magazzini Generali at Via Pietrasanta 16 (Porta Romana / Ripamonti, often spelled 'Magazine' phonetically by Spanish, French and English travellers); second, Milan's circuit of editorial magazine launch parties, Fashion Week showcases and creative-director club nights hosted across Quadrilatero, Sempione and Tortona.",
